Gaffer is a VFX application that enables look developers, lighters and
compositors to easily build, tweak, iterate and render scenes. It is a
node-based application, supporting in-application scripting in Python
and OSL, so VFX artists and technical directors can design shaders,
automate processes, and build production workflows.

It provides scene generation and processing (including USD, Alembic and
OpenVDB support via the Cortex libraries), image processing and
compositing, OpenShadingLanguage shading, and a task dispatch framework.
This port does not include support for the commercial Arnold, RenderMan
and 3Delight renderers, nor for Cycles.
